card c10
kind: teach
type: explain
tier: deeper
scored: 0
title: Go deeper: reading the name
figure: mass-number
figure_at: 2

body:
    The number after the name is the [[mass-number|mass number]]: protons plus neutrons. Carbon has 6 protons, so carbon-14 has 14 - 6 = 8 neutrons.
